ents/default/626605362275578224'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/626605362275578224'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html?showComment=1193563380000#c626605362275578224' title=''/><author><name>Dietmar-Dominik Hennig</name><uri>http://www.paxx.tv/?p=467</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3635791048021566772' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3635791048021566772' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 28, 2007 at 3:23 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-749297971313695904</id><published>2007-04-22T07:54:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-22T07:54:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Why is there not a recent photo of Genarlow?</title><content type='html'>Why is there not a recent photo of Genarlow?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/749297971313695904'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/749297971313695904'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html?showComment=1177250040000#c749297971313695904' title=''/><author><name>mike</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08395732686580075523</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3635791048021566772' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3635791048021566772' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-313052796"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 22, 2007 at 7:54 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3355552042687153602</id><published>2007-03-15T04:39:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-03-15T04:39:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>great post. beautifully and passionately written. ...</title><content type='html'>great post. beautifully and passionately written. though use of such flowery praise on my part seem inappropriate considering the horrid subject matter. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;meanwhile gerold - me thinks you do not know the US very well. believe me, we are no where near a socialist totalitarian state. in fact, we are fast approaching the exact opposite - a fascist totalitarian state. and we hardly a welfare state. compared to the western developed world, we barely have welfare at all. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;further, a big problem with schools is not that they are a fertile soil for immorality (we learn that from our government), but that they have been neglected for so long.  Finally, that you would suggest that Wilson would be better served by a few lashes, considering he is a black man living in the south, goes beyond the pale. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;and it is exactly that type of latent racism that allows for government officials to sit and do nothing knowing they will not suffer any consequences</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/3355552042687153602'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/3355552042687153602'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html?showComment=1173955140000#c3355552042687153602' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3635791048021566772' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3635791048021566772' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 15, 2007 at 4:39 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8042899905560994874</id><published>2007-03-02T11:36:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-03-02T11:36:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Unfortunately, the governor can&#39;t commute the sent...</title><content type='html'>Unfortunately, the governor can&#39;t commute the sentence and nor can the pardons board.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&#39;(2) The General Assembly may by general law approved by two-thirds of the members elected to each branch of the General Assembly in a roll-call vote provide for minimum mandatory sentences and for sentences which are required to be served in their entirety for persons convicted of armed robbery, kidnapping, rape, aggravated child molestation, aggravated sodomy, or aggravated sexual battery and, when so provided by such Act, the board shall not have the authority to consider such persons for pardon, parole, or commutation during that portion of the sentence.&#39;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Sappho&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.law.emory.edu/GEORGIA/gaconst/art-4.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/8042899905560994874'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/8042899905560994874'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html?showComment=1172860560000#c8042899905560994874' title=''/><author><name>Sappho</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03908740560687666695</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3635791048021566772' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3635791048021566772' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1758936393"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 2, 2007 at 11:36 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6813284936058609323</id><published>2007-02-18T09:12:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-02-18T09:12:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>greetings to the comrades in the USSA from the soc...</title><content type='html'>&lt;I&gt;greetings to the comrades in the USSA from the socialist republic of Austria.&lt;BR/&gt;Communism unites, doesn&#39;t it?&lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Wie geht&#39;s, gerold! Ja, communism unites, but ironically, not only those opposed to the means because they clearly see the end result, it also unites the compliant masses in affirming the means, but who are simultaneously utterly blind to the end result.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Thus, most folk actually promote and support, unknowingly and without realizing it of course, the very end (a socialist totalitarian state) that they would otherwise oppose outright by their insatiable hunger for those means I alluded to above (social programs, subsidies, deviancy freedom, etc.) which, if left unchecked, inevitably take us all to that very end.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;It&#39;s simple on one hand, yet complex on the other, to fully comprehend, I confess, as I can&#39;t even explain it precisely but my mind pictures it perfectly.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Take care, gerold. In Europa und in den Vereinigten Staaten, die meisten Politiker die W&amp;auml;hler mit lockenden Versprechungen aufs Glatteis f&amp;uuml;hren. Die Demokratische und Republikanische Parteien der USA sind zusammen und haben vieles gemeinsam: Sozialismus. &amp;Uuml;berall im Westen, es ist wesentlich derselbe.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/6813284936058609323'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/6813284936058609323'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html?showComment=1171815120000#c6813284936058609323' title=''/><author><name>dixiedog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09845646940134894119</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://members.cox.net/ogdenwb/images/dixiedog1.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3635791048021566772' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3635791048021566772' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504942784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 18, 2007 at 9:12 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5670630642266852466</id><published>2007-02-16T12:30:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-02-16T12:30:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Couldn&#39;t the governor of the state pardon him?  Wo...</title><content type='html'>Couldn&#39;t the governor of the state pardon him?  Would you be willing to send a copy of your excellent summary of this travesty of justice to him?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/5670630642266852466'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/5670630642266852466'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html?showComment=1171654200000#c5670630642266852466' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3635791048021566772' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3635791048021566772' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 16, 2007 at 12:30 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3423766907961994798</id><published>2007-02-16T02:08:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-02-16T02:08:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>This story clearly shows the similarities between ...</title><content type='html'>This story clearly shows the similarities between the two systems: statist schools and statist justice. This schools are none and so is the justice. The schools are fertile soil for every immorality while the prisons are school for criminals. A few lashes would have cured Wilson far better than any prison term and the DA with his entourage would be forced to look for an honest job (if they are at all capable of even imagine that).&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;greetings to the comrades in the USSA from the socialist republic of Austria. &lt;BR/&gt;Communism unites, doesn&#39;t it?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/3423766907961994798'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/3423766907961994798'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html?showComment=1171616880000#c3423766907961994798' title=''/><author><name>Gerold</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3635791048021566772' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3635791048021566772' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 16, 2007 at 2:08 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7272959216859509356</id><published>2007-02-15T16:59:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-02-15T16:59:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I think your last paragraph summarized it perfectl...</title><content type='html'>I think your last paragraph summarized it perfectly.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The reason that Rockdale County most likely didn&#39;t &quot;pursue the matter&quot; is because it&#39;s a haughty, richie enclave. No surprise there. But I agree that this case is faux.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Just so you know, many folk in the South view Atlanta and its richie &#39;burbs as sort of the &quot;Sodom and Gommorah&quot; of the South. If it, like  its Hellwood, San Fran, D.C., NYC, or other urban jungle sista cities, was vaporized tomorrow it wouldn&#39;t be sorely missed.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Here&#39;s a view of &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://ebaumsworld.com/2006/06/judgejudyreign.html&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Judge Judy&lt;/A&gt; that in my mind epitomizes not just Mrs. Judy, but the court system &lt;I&gt;and&lt;/I&gt; the culture at large. I empathize with the robot for what it&#39;s worth...hehe.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Enjoy.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/7272959216859509356'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3635791048021566772/comments/default/7272959216859509356'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html?showComment=1171583940000#c7272959216859509356' title=''/><author><name>dixiedog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09845646940134894119</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://members.cox.net/ogdenwb/images/dixiedog1.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/02/his-name-is-genarlow-wilson.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3635791048021566772' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3635791048021566772' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504942784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 15, 2007 at 4:59 PM"/></entry></feed>